uestions[7].evidence[1169].sources[0].title\",\n 44674\t    \"e4723\",\n 44675\t    \"Oracle Surges on AI Growth as AMD, Nvidia Stay Bullish\"\n 44676\t   ]\n 44677\t  ]\n 44678\t }\n 44679\t}-rw-r--r--@ 1 lchingen  wheel    692 Nov 23 11:05 /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/tasks/b5kzzw3xn.output\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 lchingen  wheel      0 Nov 23 11:05 /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/tasks/buduqedk6.output\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 lchingen  wheel     29 Nov 23 10:57 /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/tasks/bmrtoy7on.output\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 lchingen  wheel    213 Nov 23 10:56 /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/tasks/bi89r1zvy.output\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 lchingen  wheel     29 Nov 23 10:45 /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/tasks/bpksmodcm.output\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 lchingen  wheel    380 Nov 23 10:38 /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/tasks/bt1qa93h2.output\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 lchingen  wheel    730 Nov 23 10:30 /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/tasks/b57dye286.output\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 lchingen  wheel     32 Nov 23 10:28 /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/tasks/b9kyds3ld.output\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 lchingen  wheel     32 Nov 23 10:26 /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/tasks/b3bx6giop.output\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 lchingen  wheel    933 Nov 23 10:23 /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/tasks/b4q8egnrd.output\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 lchingen  wheel     32 Nov 23 10:21 /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-lchingen-hivemind/f1ea972d-85a1-4f27-8010-cf0b60054109/tasks/balv5wn3i.output\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 lchingen  wheel     29 Nov 23 10:1