{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'rung label|test 2|mutation|scratch anchor' docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r75b.md; nl -ba src/hivemind/service.py | sed -n '19,29p;100,124p'; nl -ba docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/RELEASE-BUILD.md | sed -n '246,270p'\"","aggregated_output":"    19\tdef open_ledger(path):\n    20\t    \"\"\"A read-only connection to a views database.\"\"\"\n    21\t    return store.open_read_only(path)\n    22\t\n    23\t\n    24\tdef default_as_of(conn):\n    25\t    \"\"\"Today's default day: the last completed day, or a legacy ledger's last judgement day. Read only through `resolve_bound`.\"\"\"\n    26\t    return store.last_completed_day(conn) or conn.execute('select max(publication_day) from judgements').fetchone()[0]\n    27\t\n    28\t\n    29\tclass FirstDayNotCompleted(ValueError):\n   100\t        cache[0] = min(cache.values())\n   101\t    if len(_SEQ_DAYS) >= 64:\n   102\t        _SEQ_DAYS.clear()\n   103\t    _SEQ_DAYS[id(conn)] = (conn, stamp, cache)\n   104\t    return cache\n   105\t\n   106\t\n   107\tdef day_of_seq(conn, seq):\n   108\t    return seq_day_map(conn).get(seq)\n   109\t\n   110\t\n   111\tdef visible(conn, seq, as_of):\n   112\t    day = day_of_seq(conn, seq)\n   113\t    return day is not None and day <= as_of\n   114\t\n   115\t\n   116\t# ---------- views\n   117\t\n   118\tdef view_exists(conn, record, as_of):\n   119\t    return visible(conn, record['created_seq'], as_of)\n   120\t\n   121\t\n   122\tdef is_open_as_of(conn, view_id, as_of):\n   123\t    for row in conn.execute('select open, after_seq from view_switches where view_id=? order by id desc', (view_id,)):\n   124\t        if visible(conn, row['after_seq'], as_of):\n   246\t## 2. State × event (one export, read-only)\n   247\t\n   248\t| State / event | What happens | What is written | Day used |\n   249\t|---|---|---|---|\n   250\t| Store's first day still in progress | `FirstDayNotCompleted`; the build stops | nothing | none |\n   251\t| Store with no completed day and no judgement, `--as-of` omitted | refused: \"no default day; supply --as-of\" | nothing | none |\n   252\t| `--as-of` not a valid date (`2026-08-99`) | refused by `date.fromisoformat` | nothing | none |\n   253\t| `--as-of` valid but not canonical (`20260825`) | refused: the stores compare days as text, so a non-canonical day would read rows from later days | nothing | none |\n   254\t| The report name is occupied, by a file, a case-variant name of an input, or a symbolic link (build or `check`) | the build refuses at the start; a name occupied later makes `publish_report` fail with `EEXIST` and exit 2; `check` exits 2 after printing; whatever is there is untouched | the package only (build) | — |\n   255\t| `--as-of` after the last completed day | `BoundNotCompleted`; the build stops | nothing | requested day |\n   256\t| `--as-of` valid, before the first visible question | empty `questions`; the report says 0 | package | bound |\n   257\t| `--as-of` omitted | last completed day (a legacy ledger: its last judgement day) | package | resolved bound |\n   258\t| View created after the bound | not exported | — | bound |\n   259\t| View closed on or before the bound | `open: false`, with no reason and no day | — | bound |\n   260\t| Closed, then reopened, before the bound | the last visible switch wins | — | bound |\n   261\t| Event or Yes/No not yet judged at the bound | `answer: null` | — | bound |\n   262\t| Evidence replaced on or before the bound | excluded; the replacement is in force | — | bound |\n   263\t| Evidence replaced after the bound | kept | — | bound |\n   264\t| Source recorded after the bound | excluded | — | bound |\n   265\t| Visible source with no row in the items database | `ReleaseRefused`, naming the evidence and input id | nothing final | bound |\n   266\t| Store written by a live run | not supported. The builder is given a snapshot (AGENTS §9), and both connections are pinned | — | — |\n   267\t| `--out` exists, empty or not, at the start | refused early; `publish` would also refuse | nothing | — |\n   268\t| `check_export`, `check_package` or `check_origins` refuses | this build's staging folder is removed, exit non-zero | nothing final | — |\n   269\t| A write, check or move fails, or a database error (`sqlite3.Error`, such as an items database with no `items` table) | exit 1; the `finally` removes this build's staging; a corrected retry at the same `--out` succeeds | nothing | — |\n   270\t| A folder, empty or not, appears at `--out` after staging | `publish` refuses with `EEXIST`; that folder is untouched; staging removed; exit 1 | nothing of this build | — |\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
